# "Exile a blue card from your hand": besides the Force, Bot1 holds only Lightning Bolt (red) and Mox Sapphire (colorless),
# so against Bot2's Duress the alternative cost is refused (the Force cannot exile itself, which is not in the hand
# while it is being cast); the scenario where a Brainstorm is held takes the same cost (force-of-will-pays-life-and-
# exiles-a-blue-card-to-counter-duress).

[Bot1 Deck]
Force of Will
Lightning Bolt
Mox Sapphire
Island x4
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Duress
Swamp x13

[Actions]
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Duress.Cast(Bot1)
! Bot1.Hand.Force of Will.Cast(Duress; Ability: exile a blue card)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Choose(Lightning Bolt)

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot1.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Hand.Count = 6
